<title>ISRAEL: Scitex Corp senior executive leaves.</title>
<headline>Scitex Corp senior executive leaves.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scitex Corp Ltd has announced that Shimon Alon, senior executive vice president and president of the Graphic Arts Group has decided to leave the company and pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>Yoav Chelouche, president and CEO of Scitex said he would be in charge of the Graphic Arts Group until further notice.</p>
<p>Alon served in various service, marketing and management positions during his 14 years at Scitex. The Graphic Arts Group is the company's largest division.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
